    "text_full": "Help Center\nLogin\nProduct\nSolutions\nResources\nAPI\nPlans & Pricing\nTry for Free\nRequest a Demo\nScale eSignature Workflows with Bulk Send: Effortless Document Distribution\nThose days of tedious, one-by-one document sending and never-ending email chains? Gone. Bulk Send empowers you to send and manage eSignature documents across hundreds or even thousands of recipients—all with a few easy clicks.\nAutomate Document Distribution at Scale with Bulk Send\nSupercharge your document workflows, reduce manual effort, and easily manage large-scale signing processes. Bulk Send puts time-consuming sending tasks on autopilot, letting you manage business processes more efficiently.\nImport recipient lists directly from CSV files and your existing systems\n\nSay goodbye to manual entry and hello to streamlined workflows. Blueink allows you to import recipient lists directly from CSV, TSV, TXT, XLS, and XLSX files, eliminating the hassle of manually inputting contact information. Whether you're dealing with a handful of contacts or thousands, our CSV integration simplifies the process, saving you time and effort.\n\nAutomatically populate documents with signer-specific data\n\nPersonalized Document Generation: Each document you send for eSignature may require specific information unique to the signer. Blueink simplifies this process by automatically populating documents with signer-specific data. Whether it's names, dates, or other relevant details, Blueink ensures that each document is customized for its recipient, enhancing accuracy and efficiency. By automating document generation, Blueink allows you to scale your eSignature workflows without compromising on quality.\n\nSend in bulk right away or schedule your bulk send for a later date\n\nWhether you need to send documents immediately or plan ahead, our platform offers flexibility to suit your needs. Send documents in bulk right away to expedite the process, or schedule your bulk send for a later date to optimize efficiency. With the ability to customize sending preferences, you're in control of your document distribution timeline.\n\nTrack the progress of your entire document batch in real time\n\nStay informed every step of the way with real-time batch tracking. Monitor the progress of your entire document batch in real time, from sending to signing and beyond. With comprehensive tracking features, you can easily keep tabs on document statuses, identify any bottlenecks, and ensure timely completion.\n\nTestimonials\nEducation\nAngelina B.\nSPED Coordinator\nLifesaver for Schools\nBlueink is very user-friendly. It is such a huge timesaver and allows our district to meet virtually and send and receive documents in real time. Users can also see when people have signed the documents, and who needs to sign with a reminder feature to resend the documents. I have no complaints about Blueink! All users are able to access the documents, sign them electronically, and receive a copy in a timely manner.\nEducation\nBette Jo T.\nAdministrative Assistant\nCustomer service is superior to Docusign\nUtilizing BlueInk has improved our department greatly! We are able to get necessary paperwork signed quickly and I love how BlueInk sends reminders when the forms are not signed. We can [also] send consent forms via BlueInk and get it signed that very same day. When using USPS, we might wait for months for the paperwork.\nEducation\nElizabeth B.\nDirector of Special Education\nExcellent product to obtain quick and easy signature\nI absolutely love this product and use it daily.\nEducation\nJason V.\nDirector of Work-Based Learning and Youth Apprenticeship Programs\nBLUEINK is the best solution that I have found for Digital Signatures in an Educational environment\nExceptional! I have told all of my colleagues about this program and am excited to present on it in the future; as it is a truly perfect fit for Work-Based Learning and Youth Apprenticeship Coordinators in Georgia!\nEducation\nJulie H.\nRecruiting\nVery impactful – bundling documents saves us money\nThe business problem we have solved is sending documents in a bundle. With our last company, we had to send individual documents, which was much more costly. Our experience [with Blueink] has been great.\nEducation\nJulie L\nHR Manager\nGrateful for this Product\nI especially like that I can obtain an electronic signature due to folks being at different locations. I also appreciate the tracking abilities. It is simply a quality product!!\nPick your plan\nBilled monthly\nBilled yearly\n\n*Save up to 40%\nStandard\n\nSimilar to DocuSign\nStandard plan - 40% less\n\n$15\nPER USER / PER MONTH\n\n$180 billed annually\n\nBuy Now\nStandard Plan includes:\n120 Envelopes / User / Year\n5 Templates / User\nBlueink Payments\nAuto Detect Fields\nReal-time audit trail\nSMS Pin / Selfie / ID Authentication\nCC Additional Recipients\nEmail / Chat Support\nBusiness Pro\n\nSimilar to DocuSign\nBusiness Pro plan - 25% less\n\n$30\nPER USER / PER MONTH\n\n$360 billed annually\n\nBuy Now\nAll Standard features, plus:\n1800 Envelopes / User / Year\n12 Templates / User\nSMS Delivery\nReminder Emails\nCustom Messaging\nAttachment Fields\nMOST POPULAR\nBlueink Unlimited\n\nSimilar to DocuSign\nProfessional Unlimited - 86% less\n\n$40\nPER USER / PER MONTH\n\n$480 billed annually\n\nBuy Now\nAll Business Pro features, plus:\nUnlimited Envelopes / User / Year\nUnlimited Templates\nTeams\nSigning Brands\nEnterprise\n\nAdvanced Solutions\n\n\n\nLet’s talk\nUNLIMITED USERS\nContact Sales\nOther benefits include:\n\nUnlimited Users\nUnlimited Templates\nBulk Send\nSmart Link Forms\nCustom Reporting\nCustomer Success Team\nAPI and Embedded Signing Access\n\nLooking for quote? Request a personalized quote from Blueink.\n\nAdvanced functionality at the best price\nFeature  name\nBlueink\nCompetitor\nCompetitor\nCompetitor\nPrice\n$15 / Per User\n$25 / Per User\n$14.99 / Per User\n$19 / Per User\nUsers\nUnlimited\nCost P